<Behavior #compose-dispatch-manifest-protocol apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #compose-dispatch-shall-provide-formal-component-manifest-contracts (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A01>
      系统应当在 `vendor/depa-processor` 中提供正式的 component manifest contract，用于声明组件的 schema、执行协议、可见性、导出配置与分发元数据。
      </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A01>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "compose-dispatch-shall-provide-formal-component-manifest-contracts" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #directory-exports-a-component-through-manifest { name = "Directory exports a component through manifest" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A02>
              它应当能够通过正式的 component manifest contract 描述该组件
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A02>
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A03>
              该 manifest 应可被上层 registry 或 composer 消费
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A03>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A04>
              某个组件目录希望导出一个可注册、可路由、可分发的组件
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A04>
              <When ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A05>
              该目录编写自己的 `index.ts`
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A05>
            )>
            <Case #manifest-carries-execution-protocol-without-moving-business-logic-into-vendor { name = "Manifest carries execution protocol without moving business logic into vendor" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A06>
              manifest 应表达组件的导出与分发元数据
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A06>
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A07>
              vendor 不应要求把具体业务逻辑迁入 `depa-processor`
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A07>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A08>
              某个组件已经通过 `runByFuncStyleAdapter` 或等价协议定义执行逻辑
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A08>
              <When ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A09>
              该组件被包装为 manifest
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A09>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #compose-dispatch-shall-preserve-directory-level-index-as-manifest-authoring-layer (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0A>
      系统应当保留每个组件目录中的 `index.ts` 作为 manifest/export 编排层，而不是要求统一取消目录级显式导出控制。
      </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0A>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "compose-dispatch-shall-preserve-directory-level-index-as-manifest-authoring-layer" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #tool-directory-wants-explicit-export-control { name = "Tool directory wants explicit export control" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0B>
              其 `index.ts` 应当能够继续作为正式 export 编排层存在
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0B>
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0C>
              不应被强制替换为不可控的全自动导出机制
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0C>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0D>
              某个 tool 目录需要精确控制本目录导出哪些组件
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0D>
              <When ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0E>
              该目录使用 `vendor/depa-processor`
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0E>
            )>
            <Case #directory-index-chooses-what-not-to-export { name = "Directory index chooses what not to export" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0F>
              `index.ts` 应当能够显式决定导出哪些 manifest、忽略哪些内部组件
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0F>
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0G>
              组件的导出边界应由目录作者控制
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0G>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0H>
              某个组件目录内部包含多个逻辑实现或多个实验性变体
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0H>
              <When ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0J>
              目录作者编写该目录的 `index.ts`
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0J>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #compose-dispatch-shall-support-variant-based-manifest-export (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0K>
      系统应当允许同一目录导出多个变体 manifest，使不同配置、不同 prompt、不同 schema、不同 capability surface 可以由目录级 `index.ts` 显式控制。
      </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0K>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "compose-dispatch-shall-support-variant-based-manifest-export" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #tasktree-exports-flat-and-tree-variants { name = "Tasktree exports flat and tree variants" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0M>
              它应当能够导出多个变体 manifest
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0M>
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0N>
              不同变体应能够绑定不同的 prompt、schema 或 capability 配置
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0N>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0P>
              某个组件目录同时支持单层任务模式和树形任务模式
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0P>
              <When ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0Q>
              该目录定义其导出 manifest
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0Q>
            )>
            <Case #variant-manifest-changes-prompt-and-schema-together { name = "Variant manifest changes prompt and schema together" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0R>
              该 variant 应一并切换其 prompt、schema 与导出元数据
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0R>
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0S>
              不需要为每个变体复制整套目录结构
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0S>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0T>
              两个组件变体共享核心逻辑，但使用不同 prompt 和不同输入约束
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0T>
              <When ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0V>
              调用方选择某个 variant manifest
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0V>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #compose-dispatch-shall-provide-bundle-and-registry-composition-foundations (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0W>
      系统应当在 `vendor/depa-processor` 中提供 bundle manifest、registry composer、route bundle 或 command bundle 等能力，使组件分发不再长期依赖全局静态列表手工聚合。
      </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0W>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "compose-dispatch-shall-provide-bundle-and-registry-composition-foundations" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #multiple-manifests-are-composed-into-registry { name = "Multiple manifests are composed into registry" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0X>
              应当能够通过 bundle/registry composition foundation 完成该装配
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0X>
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0Y>
              不应长期依赖单一的手写全局静态列表作为唯一正式组合方式
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0Y>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0Z>
              上层 runtime 需要从多个目录收集组件并装配成 registry 或 route table
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A0Z>
              <When ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A10>
              上层依赖 `vendor/depa-processor`
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A10>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #first-iteration-shall-be-verifiable-through-a-real-directory-level-variant-adoption (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A11>
      系统应当在本 capability 第一轮中使用至少一个真实组件目录完成 manifest variant adoption，以验证该协议不是停留在 vendor 内部抽象。
      </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A11>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "first-iteration-shall-be-verifiable-through-a-real-directory-level-variant-adoption" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #real-tasktree-like-directory-adopts-manifest-protocol { name = "Real tasktree-like directory adopts manifest protocol" } [
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A12>
              该目录应至少提供两个可区分的 variant manifest
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A12>
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A13>
              上层应能基于这些 manifest 完成最小的 registry 或 route 装配
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A13>
              <Then ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A14>
              该验证不应仅停留在 vendor 自测中的虚构示例
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A14>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A15>
              仓库内存在一个真实组件目录，具有 prompt/schema/config 差异化导出需求
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A15>
              <When ?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A16>
              第一轮实现完成
              </?01M05F1P1Z6WSD7K6SVN980A16>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
